UnitNostrVerify::hashNostrClaim
└── when hashing a golden binding tuple
    └── it matches the client struct hash


UnitNostrVerify::npubHashFromPubkey
└── when hashing a pubkey with the NIP-19 npub prefix byte
    └── it matches the golden npub hash


UnitNostrVerify::verifyNostrClaimSignature
├── when the signature is valid
│   └── it verifies successfully
├── when the signature is invalid
│   └── it reverts
├── when the signature length is invalid
│   └── it reverts
└── when the name does not match the signed digest
    └── it reverts
